<title>JAPAN: Sophia Systems - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sophia Systems - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.21		vs	    1.77</p>
<p> Operating    loss 44    million    vs   loss 181    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 43    million    vs   loss 177    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 46    million    vs   loss 180    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.22 yen	  vs    loss 12.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sophia Systems Co Ltd is a leading domestic maker of support equipment for microcomputer development.</p>
</text>
